DESCRIPTION >
    One-row manifest for the current frozen shadow rebuild. Keeping metadata separate from
    fact rows makes an exact rebuild of an empty source universe representable.

SCHEMA >
    `tenant_id` LowCardinality(String) `json:$.tenant_id`,
    `rebuild_id` FixedString(64) `json:$.rebuild_id`,
    `batch_version` UInt64 `json:$.batch_version`,
    `snapshot_at` DateTime64(6) `json:$.snapshot_at`,
    `input_event_count` UInt64 `json:$.input_event_count`,
    `input_hash` FixedString(64) `json:$.input_hash`

ENGINE MergeTree
ENGINE_SORTING_KEY tenant_id, rebuild_id
